er", "video_id": "8GAxomeFSmQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8GAxomeFSmQ", "title": "[Blue Archive] Vol.3 Eden Treaty Chapter4 'Kyrie of the Forgotten Gods' Open!", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8GAxomeFSmQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}